The models loop is clunky (`$code === null ? ...`). modelsByProvider is keyed by provider and has the form [provider => [code => ['code' => code]]]. Fix the loop:

```php
foreach ($catalog->modelsByProvider as $provider => $models) {
    foreach ($models as $code => $unused) {
        $this->db->executeStatement('INSERT INTO models (provider, code) VALUES (:provider, :code) ON CONFLICT (provider, code) DO NOTHING', ['provider' => $provider, 'code' => $code]);
        ++$counts['models'];
    }
}
```
And remove providerOf. Clean up the unused import of ArrayParameterBag.

